player_prompt.intro:
Oli Player {player_id} mu mizannyo ya 3 eya Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. Omupiira guwa {num_rounds} round.
Nkola ya round:
• {conv_rounds} zamu za kuwagamanya
• 1 zamu ya kufanya ndagiriro - sonyeza token moja kwa buli mukwano: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' oba '[<opp-id> defect]' (nga '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; ekisinga kye kya 'cooperate').
Matiriisi ya mapato ya kuwaganya (egagibwa ku buli kikundi ekitasosole):
  - Bombi bwegassi  ->  {reward}
  - Bombi bwenyigiri     ->  {punishment}
  - Oli wenya, be gassi -> {temptation}
  - Oli gassi, be wenya -> {sucker}
Omuzannyi (aba muzannyi) ali na akala za juu zaidi ku nkomerero ya round zote azawangula.
